**Vita**

Michael Scott Daugherity was born to Louis and Mary Daugherity in Oklahoma City, Oklahoma on March 6, 1979. After graduating Putnam City West High School in Bethany, OK in 1997, he received dual Bachelor of Science degrees in Physics and Computer Science from Abilene Christian University in Abilene, TX in May 2002. During this time, he married Elizabeth Ann Hull on May 21, 2000. He continued his education at the University of Texas at Austin enrolling in August 2002 and advancing to doctoral candidacy in October 2004, one month before his daughter, Molly Ann Daugherity, was born.

